#: ../../quickstart.md:1
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "Mwanzo wa haraka"

#: ../../quickstart.md:3
msgid "Make your first request and read the response in about five minutes."
msgstr "Fanya ombi lako la kwanza na usome jibu ndani ya takriban dakika tano."

#: ../../quickstart.md:5
msgid ""
"You need one of these on your machine: `curl`, Python 3.9 or later with "
"the `requests` package, or Node.js 18 or later. Nothing else to install."
msgstr ""
"Unahitaji mojawapo ya hivi kwenye kompyuta yako: `curl`, Python 3.9 au "
"ya baadaye yenye package ya `requests`, au Node.js 18 au ya baadaye. "
"Huhitaji kusakinisha kitu kingine."

#: ../../quickstart.md:7
msgid "1. Set your environment"
msgstr "1. Weka mazingira yako"

#: ../../quickstart.md:9
msgid ""
"Your API key and the server address live in environment variables, so "
"they never end up in your code."
msgstr ""
"API key yako na anwani ya server huhifadhiwa katika environment variables, "
"ili zisiishie kamwe ndani ya code yako."

#: ../../quickstart.md:11
msgid "The demo key below is public. It is limited to 10 requests per minute."
msgstr ""
"Demo key iliyo hapa chini ni ya umma. Ina kikomo cha requests 10 kwa dakika."

#: ../../quickstart.md:19
msgid ""
"If the demo server has been idle, the first request can take up to a "
"minute to respond. Later requests are fast."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa demo server imekuwa bila kutumika, request ya kwanza inaweza kuchukua "
"hadi dakika moja kujibu. Requests zinazofuata huwa za haraka."

#: ../../quickstart.md:22
msgid "2. Send your first request"
msgstr "2. Tuma ombi lako la kwanza"

#: ../../quickstart.md:24
msgid "Ask the large model a question. Pick the tab for your language."
msgstr ""
"Uliza large model swali. Chagua kichupo cha lugha yako."

#: ../../quickstart.md
msgid "curl"
msgstr "curl"

#: ../../quickstart.md
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: ../../quickstart.md
msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript"

#: ../../quickstart.md:49
msgid "3. Read the response"
msgstr "3. Soma jibu"

#: ../../quickstart.md:51
msgid ""
"A successful request returns status `200` and a JSON body like this. Your"
" `id` will differ."
msgstr ""
"Request iliyofanikiwa hurudisha status `200` na JSON body kama hii. "
"`id` yako itakuwa tofauti."

#: ../../quickstart.md:68
msgid ""
"The model is a stub, so `output` repeats your prompt inside a fixed "
"sentence. That keeps every example on these pages reproducible. The shape"
" of the response is what matters here."
msgstr ""
"Model ni stub, kwa hivyo `output` hurudia prompt yako ndani ya sentensi "
"iliyowekwa. Hii hufanya kila mfano kwenye kurasa hizi uweze kurudiwa "
"kwa matokeo yale yale. Kinachojalisha hapa ni muundo wa response."

#: ../../quickstart.md:70
msgid "`id`"
msgstr "`id`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:71
msgid ""
"A unique ID for this generation. Log it if you need to refer to the "
"generation later."
msgstr ""
"ID ya kipekee ya generation hii. Iweke kwenye log ikiwa utahitaji "
"kurejelea generation hii baadaye."

#: ../../quickstart.md:73
msgid "`model`"
msgstr "`model`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:74
msgid "The model that handled the request."
msgstr "Model iliyoshughulikia request."

#: ../../quickstart.md:76
msgid "`language`"
msgstr "`language`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:77
msgid "The language code you sent. If you leave it out, it defaults to `en`."
msgstr ""
"Language code uliyotuma. Ukiiacha, thamani ya kawaida huwa `en`."

#: ../../quickstart.md:79
msgid "`output`"
msgstr "`output`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:80
msgid "The generated text."
msgstr "Maandishi yaliyotengenezwa."

#: ../../quickstart.md:82
msgid "`finish_reason`"
msgstr "`finish_reason`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:83
msgid ""
"Why the response ended. `stop` means it finished naturally. `length` "
"means it hit your `max_tokens` limit and was cut off."
msgstr ""
"Sababu iliyofanya response iishe. `stop` inamaanisha iliisha kawaida. "
"`length` inamaanisha ilifikia kikomo chako cha `max_tokens` na ikakatwa."

#: ../../quickstart.md:85
msgid "`usage`"
msgstr "`usage`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:86
msgid ""
"How many tokens the request used. `total_tokens` is `prompt_tokens` plus "
"`completion_tokens`. See [Tokens and languages](tokens.md) for how tokens"
" are counted."
msgstr ""
"Idadi ya tokens zilizotumiwa na request. `total_tokens` ni `prompt_tokens` "
"pamoja na `completion_tokens`. Angalia [Tokens and languages](tokens.md) "
"kwa maelezo ya jinsi tokens zinavyohesabiwa."

#: ../../quickstart.md:88
msgid "When the response is cut off"
msgstr "Wakati response inakatwa"

#: ../../quickstart.md:90
msgid ""
"Set `max_tokens` to 10 and send the same prompt. The output stops early "
"and `finish_reason` changes to `length`."
msgstr ""
"Weka `max_tokens` kuwa 10 na utume prompt hiyo hiyo. Output itaacha mapema "
"na `finish_reason` itabadilika kuwa `length`."

#: ../../quickstart.md:107
msgid ""
"If you see `length` and you expected a full answer, raise `max_tokens`. "
"Each model has its own ceiling, listed under `max_output_tokens` in the "
"[model list](#choose-a-model-and-language)."
msgstr ""
"Ukiona `length` na ulitarajia jibu kamili, ongeza `max_tokens`. Kila model "
"ina kikomo chake, kilichoonyeshwa chini ya `max_output_tokens` katika "
"[model list](#choose-a-model-and-language)."

#: ../../quickstart.md:109
msgid "Response headers"
msgstr "Response headers"

#: ../../quickstart.md:111
msgid "Every response carries headers worth knowing about."
msgstr "Kila response ina headers ambazo ni muhimu kuzifahamu."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Header"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Maana"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-Request-ID`"
msgstr "`X-Request-ID`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Unique ID for this request. Quote it when you contact support."
msgstr ""
"ID ya kipekee ya request hii. Itaje unapowasiliana na support."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-Data-Region`"
msgstr "`X-Data-Region`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "The region that processed the request. Only on `/v1/generate`."
msgstr ""
"Region iliyochakata request. Inapatikana tu kwenye `/v1/generate`."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "How many requests you get per minute."
msgstr "Idadi ya requests unazopata kwa dakika."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "How many you have left in the current minute."
msgstr "Idadi ya requests zilizobaki katika dakika ya sasa."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Seconds until the counter resets."
msgstr "Idadi ya sekunde hadi counter ijipange upya."

#: ../../quickstart.md:121
msgid "Choose a model and language"
msgstr "Chagua model na lugha"

#: ../../quickstart.md:123
msgid "List the models to see which languages each one accepts."
msgstr "Orodhesha models ili kuona kila moja inakubali lugha zipi."

#: ../../quickstart.md:146
msgid ""
"The language codes are `en` English, `sw` Swahili, `ha` Hausa, `yo` "
"Yoruba, `lg` Luganda and `am` Amharic. If you send a language the model "
"does not support, you get an `unsupported_language` error that lists the "
"ones it does. See [Errors](errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Language codes ni `en` English, `sw` Swahili, `ha` Hausa, `yo` Yoruba, "
"`lg` Luganda na `am` Amharic. Ukituma lugha ambayo model haiungi mkono, "
"utapata error ya `unsupported_language` inayoorodhesha lugha inazounga "
"mkono. Angalia [Errors](errors.md)."

#: ../../quickstart.md:148
msgid "Choose a region"
msgstr "Chagua region"

#: ../../quickstart.md:150
msgid ""
"The `region` parameter tells the service where to process your request. "
"Use `ke` for Kenya, `ug` for Uganda, `ma` for Morocco or `mu` for "
"Mauritius. If you leave it out, the default is `ke`. The `X-Data-Region` "
"response header confirms where the request ran."
msgstr ""
"Parameter ya `region` huiambia service mahali pa kuchakata request yako. "
"Tumia `ke` kwa Kenya, `ug` kwa Uganda, `ma` kwa Morocco au `mu` kwa "
"Mauritius. Ukiiacha, default ni `ke`. Response header ya `X-Data-Region` "
"huthibitisha mahali request ilitekelezwa."

#: ../../quickstart.md:152
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "Hatua zinazofuata"

#: ../../quickstart.md:154
msgid "[Authentication](authentication.md) explains keys in more detail."
msgstr "[Authentication](authentication.md) inaeleza keys kwa undani zaidi."

#: ../../quickstart.md:155
msgid "[Errors](errors.md) covers every error and which ones to retry."
msgstr "[Errors](errors.md) inaeleza kila error na ni zipi za kujaribu tena."

#: ../../quickstart.md:156
msgid "[Production checklist](production.md) is what to review before you ship."
msgstr ""
"[Production checklist](production.md) ndiyo ya kukagua kabla ya ku-release."